  requirements   = '[{"number":"1","text":"Do the following:"},{"number":"2","text":"Explain what light pollution is and how it and air pollution affect astronomy."},{"number":"3","text":"With the aid of diagrams (or real telescopes if available), do the following:"},{"number":"4","text":"Do the following (if instruction is done in a planetarium, Scouts must still identify the required stars and constellations outside under the natural night sky):"},{"number":"5","text":"Do the following:"},{"number":"6","text":"Do the following:"},{"number":"7","text":"Do the following:"},{"number":"8","text":"With your counselor''s approval and guidance, do ONE of the following:"},{"number":"9","text":"Do ONE of the following:"}]'::jsonb,
